license: MIT
abstract: >
  Standalone verification artifacts for a constructive lower bound
  F4 > 4.4416832003 on the reciprocal sum of an explicit infinite
  four-term-progression-free set. The package supplies the fixed
  witness, a 1,384-state digit automaton, and solver-free verification
  code. Discovery software and search records are withheld.
